    "title": "Heart disease in women: Small daily habits can make a big difference - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Reyna Crooms ,\n1 days ago WILMINGTON, N.C. (WECT) - As February marks American Heart Month, a local cardiologist and a Wilmington woman are sharing how small, daily habits can help improve heart health. According to the Centers for Disease Control and Prevention (CDC), heart disease impacts more than 40% of women in the United States. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
